{"articleNo":"119528","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=119528&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"음주 예방교육 실시 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.12.19","hit":"2754","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">연말 연시를 맞이하여 교내 건전한 음주 문화를&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">정착하고 </span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">학생 및 교직원의 건강 증진을 위하여&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">다음과 같이</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">음주예방 교육을 실시하니 널리&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">홍보하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 주 제 : <strong><font color=\"#ff007f\">음주 폐해 바로 알기</font></strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2. 기 간 : 2014. 12. 22.(월) ~ 2015. 1. 16.(금)</span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 교육내용</span></span></p><br><br><br><br><p>* 위 영상이 열리지않는 분들은 아래파일 링크를 참조하여 주시기 바랍니다.</p><p>▶ <a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/content_files/ynsa20141219.wmv\" alt=\"음주예방\">음주폐해 예방교육 동영상 다운로드</a><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">4. 상영시간 : 10분 </span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">5. 제작기관 : 청소년 음주흡연 예방 협회</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 2014. 12.</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong> 학 생 처 장</strong></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
